DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
27454::$$$message_0203_0000_0000$$$::"~[humming]"[lr]::
27455::$$$message_0203_0000_0001$$$::I have some spare time, so I briskly do the prep for tomorrow's breakfast.[lr]::
27456::$$$message_0203_0000_0002$$$::"Hey, Emiya. Come here!"[lr]::
27457::$$$message_0203_0000_0003$$$::Oh, Tohsaka's calling me.::
27458::$$$message_0203_0001_0000$$$::"Rin's done with the bath. I'll use it next, then."[lr]::
27459::$$$message_0203_0001_0001$$$::"Rider, you should use it too. I still have some work to finish."[lr]::
27460::$$$message_0203_0001_0002$$$::"But Sakura, you should..."::
27461::$$$message_0203_0002_0000$$$::I listen to the conversation as I head into the hallway.::
27462::$$$message_0203_0003_0000$$$::...I'll bathe last, so I'll turn off the gas.[lr]::
27463::$$$message_0203_0003_0001$$$::I'll need to let the steam out after all the girls use the bath so I don't get dizzy. More importantly, though...::
27464::$$$message_0203_0004_0000$$$::"Hm. What, Tohsaka...oh."[lr]::
27465::$$$message_0203_0004_0001$$$::She's already gone off to the guesthouse.[lr]::
27466::$$$message_0203_0004_0002$$$::Can't she at least stay in one place while she asks to see someone?::
27467::$$$message_0203_0005_0000$$$::"...I wonder if I should bring her something, since she just took a bath."[lr]::
27468::$$$message_0203_0005_0001$$$::No, that's only necessary for Fuji-nee.[lr]::
27469::$$$message_0203_0005_0002$$$::She pouts if she doesn't get to have a drink after bathing.::
27470::$$$message_0203_0006_0000$$$::"What's so good about it anyway? Does she just like the feeling of cooling her throat?"[lr]::
27471::$$$message_0203_0006_0001$$$::I grumble to myself on the way to Tohsaka's room.::
27472::$$$message_0203_0007_0000$$$::"Tohsaka, I'm coming in."[lr]::
27473::$$$message_0203_0007_0001$$$::"Oh, there you are. Come on in."[lr]::
27474::$$$message_0203_0007_0002$$$::She sounds oddly upbeat.[lr]::
27475::$$$message_0203_0007_0003$$$::But what kind of rule of equivalent exchange is this that I feel anxious whenever she's in high spirits...?::
27476::$$$message_0203_0008_0000$$$::"...You needed something?"[lr]::
27477::$$$message_0203_0008_0001$$$::"You don't need to be so nervous. I'm not going to kidnap and eat you."::
27478::$$$message_0203_0009_0000$$$::I must be overly on edge.[lr]::
27479::$$$message_0203_0009_0001$$$::Actually, Tohsaka smells nice after her bath...which only adds to my nervousness being alone with her in her bedroom at night.::
27480::$$$message_0203_0010_0000$$$::"Now, there's only one reason I asked you to come here, Emiya..."[lr]::
27481::$$$message_0203_0010_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
27482::$$$message_0203_0010_0002$$$::"You're the only one I can ask..."::
27483::$$$message_0203_0011_0000$$$::She opens with a suggestive sentence.[wshock canskip=0][fg index=3000 opacity=0 time=200 pos=l storage=凛特殊02b(近) textoff=0][lr]::
27484::$$$message_0203_0011_0001$$$::[movefg opacity=0 time=800 pos=l accel=-2 storage=凛私服11a(近) textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 time=800 pos=c accel=-2 storage=凛特殊02b(近) textoff=0]There's no telling what I might end up doing under all this nervousness, yet she's making it worse...[wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0]::
27485::$$$message_0203_0012_0000$$$::"Massage my shoulders."[lr]::
27486::$$$message_0203_0012_0001$$$::"...What?"[lr]::
27487::$$$message_0203_0012_0002$$$::"My shoulders! Having them massaged feels great right after a bath."::
27488::$$$message_0203_0013_0000$$$::...She blew away my sweet expectations in a single strike,[lr]::
27489::$$$message_0203_0013_0001$$$::like a baseball batted straight into the net at a batting cage.[se volume=40 storage=se139.wav]::
27490::$$$message_0203_0014_0000$$$::"...Hey, you really are the only person I can ask to do this. I feel shy asking Saber or Sakura, and Rider's liable to crush my collarbone."[lr]::
27491::$$$message_0203_0014_0001$$$::"True. Guess it's gotta be me."::
27492::$$$message_0203_0015_0000$$$::It's tragic how plausible that is.[lr]::
27493::$$$message_0203_0015_0001$$$::Still, the thought that I'm the only one Tohsaka can ask for a massage after a bath...[lr]::
27494::$$$message_0203_0015_0002$$$::...I can think of Servants who might be good at it, though.[lr]::
27495::$$$message_0203_0015_0003$$$::But before that...::
27496::$$$message_0203_0016_0000$$$::"Are your shoulders stiff, Tohsaka?"[lr]::
27497::$$$message_0203_0016_0001$$$::"Yeah, my blood pressure normally isn't very high, so I have poor circulation. My body gets stiff easily."[lr]::
27498::$$$message_0203_0016_0002$$$::"It's not like you carry enough weight to make your shoulders stiff..."::
27499::$$$message_0203_0017_0000$$$::...Or so I've heard. Could it be true?[lr]::
27500::$$$message_0203_0017_0001$$$::As a male, it's outside the realm of my imagination, but I have a feeling someone like Sakura would be familiar with it.::
27501::$$$message_0203_0018_0000$$$::"What was that, Emiya?"[lr]::
27502::$$$message_0203_0018_0001$$$::"Oh, I totally wasn't thinking about how Sakura looks like she might get stiff shoulders but you are questionable."[lr]::
27503::$$$message_0203_0018_0002$$$::"I'll just pretend I didn't hear that."::
27504::$$$message_0203_0019_0000$$$::I almost stepped on a landmine.[lr]::
27505::$$$message_0203_0019_0001$$$::But now that I've avoided it, there's no escaping my new role as a masseur.::
27506::$$$message_0203_0020_0000$$$::"You seem like you'd be good at this."[lr]::
27507::$$$message_0203_0020_0001$$$::"Not to brag, but I've been trained by Fuji-nee, so I'm a little confident."[lr]::
27508::$$$message_0203_0020_0002$$$::"Haha, she [font italic=true]would[font italic=false] ask you to.[cacheimage storage=凛私服01e(近)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服01e(近) textoff=0] I'm jealous."::
27509::$$$message_0203_0021_0000$$$::"Really?"[lr]::
27510::$$$message_0203_0021_0001$$$::"Not of the massage, but the fact that she has someone she can ask whenever she wants."[lr]::
27511::$$$message_0203_0021_0002$$$::"Is that so... She's never given me a shoulder massage... Wait, I guess she has..."::
27512::$$$message_0203_0022_0000$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服05b(近) textoff=0]Sometimes she'll just come up to me and say, "my my, Shirou. You are pretty stiff too..." Ahh.::
27513::$$$message_0203_0023_0000$$$::"...Somehow it would turn into a seitai experiment and end up being a seminar to develop new submission techniques..."[lr]::
27514::$$$message_0203_0023_0001$$$::"I take it back. I'm not jealous of that at all."::
27515::$$$message_0203_0024_0000$$$::I think I just exposed another ridiculous fact about myself and Fuji-nee.[lr]::
27516::$$$message_0203_0024_0001$$$::Even I think it's a mystery as to why she turns it into serious Newaza training between me and her, when she's a whole zodiac cycle older than me.::
27517::$$$message_0203_0025_0000$$$::"...No joint locks and seitai, please. Just give me a normal massage."[lr]::
27518::$$$message_0203_0025_0001$$$::"I won't ask for payment, so relax... Well then, Tohsaka..."::
27519::$$$message_0203_0026_0000$$$::I stand behind her and grab her shoulders.[lr]::
27520::$$$message_0203_0026_0001$$$::...Wow, her hair gives off a nice scent...::
27521::$$$message_0203_0027_0000$$$::"Shirou? Is something wrong?"[lr]::
27522::$$$message_0203_0027_0001$$$::"...It's nothing. I'm just a little nervous. It's my first time."::
27523::$$$message_0203_0028_0000$$$::[clfg time=300 rule=シャッター左から pos=all textoff=0]I'm not nervous because it's my first time giving a shoulder massage.[lr]::
27524::$$$message_0203_0028_0001$$$::Tohsaka's shoulders and neck are slender. Ahh, it really reminds me that she's a girl.[lr]::
27525::$$$message_0203_0028_0002$$$::...Calm down, man.[lr]::
27526::$$$message_0203_0028_0003$$$::It's just a shoulder massage. A massage. Nothing more.::
27527::$$$message_0203_0029_0000$$$::"I'll kill you if you touch me anywhere weird."[lr]::
27528::$$$message_0203_0029_0001$$$::"...Even if you're stiff there?"[lr]::
27529::$$$message_0203_0029_0002$$$::"...Dummy."::
27530::$$$message_0203_0030_0000$$$::[clfg time=300 rule=シャッター左から pos=all textoff=0]That calms me down, actually.[lr]::
27531::$$$message_0203_0030_0001$$$::I wrap my hands around Tohsaka's shoulders, feeling for her stiffness with my fingers...::
27532::$$$message_0203_0031_0000$$$::"Ah, Miss, you're very stiff here."[lr]::
27533::$$$message_0203_0031_0001$$$::"I know, right? I'm a hard-working woman."[lr]::
27534::$$$message_0203_0031_0002$$$::"You must have it rough."[lr]::
27535::$$$message_0203_0031_0003$$$::"My incompetent apprentice makes me worry."::
27536::$$$message_0203_0032_0000$$$::So it's my fault?[lr]::
27537::$$$message_0203_0032_0001$$$::...Is this shoulder massage her way of making me clean up my mess?::
27538::$$$message_0203_0033_0000$$$::"I'm kidding. If my shoulders got stiff because of you, I'd be dead of vasocongestion by now."[lr]::
27539::$$$message_0203_0033_0001$$$::"That's harsh. So you wouldn't get stiff shoulders if I was a little better?"::
27540::$$$message_0203_0034_0000$$$::She groans in response to the massage.[lr]::
27541::$$$message_0203_0034_0001$$$::When I knead the area under her collarbone, she squeals with delight.::
27542::$$$message_0203_0035_0000$$$::"I wonder.[lr]::
27543::$$$message_0203_0035_0001$$$::Ahh, I'm glad I asked you for a massage, though. I haven't really had one before."[lr]::
27544::$$$message_0203_0035_0002$$$::"...I bet."::
27545::$$$message_0203_0036_0000$$$::Tohsaka's lived alone for a long time, and she probably doesn't have anyone she can easily ask at school. Maybe Mitsuzuri.::
27546::$$$message_0203_0037_0000$$$::"I've never quite been able to relax enough to leave my back open to someone.[lr]::
27547::$$$message_0203_0037_0001$$$::I guess paranoia is par for the course in our trade. It would actually be dangerous to get a massage."[lr]::
27548::$$$message_0203_0037_0002$$$::"And you have appearances to keep up at school.[lr]::
27549::$$$message_0203_0037_0003$$$::You can't just go up to someone and ask, 'Would you be so kind as to massage my shoulders?'"::
27550::$$$message_0203_0038_0000$$$::"...Hmm? So you still see me that way, Emiya."[lr]::
27551::$$$message_0203_0038_0001$$$::"Not me, but if you went around cracking your neck, you'd destroy all of the underclassmen's fantasies. I don't recommend it."::
27552::$$$message_0203_0039_0000$$$::I use acupressure to start massaging from the nape of her neck and go upward.[lr]::
27553::$$$message_0203_0039_0001$$$::Hm... She's rather stiff here. It makes me consider buying some bath bombs that help relieve shoulder soreness.::
27554::$$$message_0203_0040_0000$$$::"Ugggh... Mmm, haaah... That hits the spot.[lr]::
27555::$$$message_0203_0040_0001$$$::This is enough to make me appreciate the fact you're here, you know."[lr]::
27556::$$$message_0203_0040_0002$$$::"Good. Then I'll thoroughly massage you tonight until you collapse."[lr]::
27557::$$$message_0203_0040_0003$$$::"Wait, if you do that... Ah..."::
27558::$$$message_0203_0041_0000$$$::[clfg time=300 rule=シャッター左から pos=all textoff=0]Tohsaka trails off, giving herself completely over to the massage.[lr]::
27559::$$$message_0203_0041_0001$$$::Her voice is...a little coquettish. I suppose that isn't a bad thing.::
27560::$$$message_0203_0042_0000$$$::"Mm... Ahh, there... Whew. That feels great."[lr]::
27561::$$$message_0203_0042_0001$$$::"Fuh, but we're just getting warmed up. The real massage starts now, Tohsaka...!"[lr]::
27562::$$$message_0203_0042_0002$$$::"Wait, you're still going!? [cacheimage storage=凛私服13c(近)][wvl][shock vmax=10 time=1800 count=25][chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服13c(近) pos=c textoff=0]Hnnngh!"::
27563::$$$message_0203_0043_0000$$$::Her shriek of relaxation echoes through the guesthouse.[lr]::
27564::$$$message_0203_0043_0001$$$::And so, the evening massage goes on.[lr]::
27565::$$$message_0203_0043_0002$$$::My hands are starting to hurt, though...::
927532::$$$message_9203_0031_0000$$$::"Ah, Miss, you're very stiff here."[r]:��